  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "- **`TessageId` loses its parameterless constructor, which made a new version 7 id: `TessageId.New()` makes one now.** System.Text.Json, finding the constructor, read every `TessageId` back as a new one, with nothing failing. It now writes and reads a `TessageId` as its `Guid` string, with the `EntityIdJsonConverter` of Compze.Abstractions, which `TessageId` carries. Its constructor's parameter is named `value`, where it was `id`.\n- **Requires newer minor versions of other Compze packages:** Compze.Abstractions 0.5.0-alpha (was 0.4.0-alpha), Compze.Internals.SystemCE 0.12.0-internal (was 0.8.0-internal), Compze.Threading 0.14.0-alpha (was 0.12.0-alpha). Upgrading to this version upgrades each package listed here too, so their changelogs apply to this upgrade as well.",
